/wiki/%E8%A7%A3%E5%89%96%E5%AD%B8%E8%A1%93%E8%AA%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"解剖學術語\">TA98</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.unifr.ch/ifaa/Public/EntryPage/TA98%20Tree/Entity%20TA98%20EN/04.1.04.001%20Entity%20TA98%20EN.htm\">A04.1.04.001</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A7%A3%E5%89%96%E5%AD%B8%E8%A1%93%E8%AA%9E\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"解剖學術語\">TA2</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ta2viewer.openanatomy.org/?id=2104\">2104</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A7%A3%E5%89%96%E5%AD%A6%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B\" title=\"解剖學基礎模型\">FMA</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FMA_74060\">FMA:74060</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" class=\"infobox-label\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%A0%BC%E9%9B%B7%E6%B0%8F%E8%A7%A3%E5%89%96%E5%AD%B8\" title=\"格雷氏解剖學\">格雷氏</a></th><td class=\"infobox-data\" style=\"\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://archive.org/stream/anatomyofhumanbo1918gray#page/385/mode/2up\">p.385</a></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" class=\"infobox-below\">《<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"肌肉解剖学术语\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Anatomical terms of muscle\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%82%8C%E8%82%89%E8%A7%A3%E5%89%96%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%AF%E8%AF%AD&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"肌肉解剖學術語（頁面不存在）\">肌肉解剖學術語</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anatomical_terms_of_muscle\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Anatomical terms of muscle\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Anatomical terms of muscle</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>》<div style=\"text-align: right;\"><small class=\"noprint\">&#91;<a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q286978\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"d:Q286978\">在維基數據上編輯</a>&#93;</small></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>咀嚼肌</b>（muscles of mastication）指參與<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%92%80%E5%9A%BC\" title=\"咀嚼\">咀嚼</a>的四對肌肉。咀嚼可分為咬合及張口兩個動作，其中<a href=\"/wiki/%E5%92%80%E5%9A%BC\" title=\"咀嚼\">咬合肌</a>共有三對。僅有<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"外翼肌\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"lateral pterygoid muscle\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%96%E7%BF%BC%E8%82%8C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"外翼肌（頁面不存在）\">外翼肌</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/lateral_pterygoid_muscle\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:lateral pterygoid muscle\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">lateral pterygoid muscle</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>一條負責將<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"顳頜關節\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Temporomandibular joint\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A1%B3%E9%A0%9C%E9%97%9C%E7%AF%80&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"顳頜關節（頁面不存在）\">顳頜關節</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Temporomandibular_joint\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Temporomandibular joint\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Temporomandibular joint</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>鬆開，協助張口。\n</p>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"構成\"><span id=\".E6.A7.8B.E6.88.90\"></span>構成</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%92%80%E5%9A%BC%E8%82%8C&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：構成\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>構成咀嚼肌群的肌肉包含：\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%9A%BC%E8%82%8C\" title=\"嚼肌\">嚼肌</a>（有淺端跟深端）</li>\n<li><span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"顳肌\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"temporalis\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A1%B3%E8%82%8C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"顳肌（頁面不存在）\">顳肌</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/temporalis\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:temporalis\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">temporalis</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>（有些書認為<span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"蝶下颌肌\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"sphenomandibularis\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%9D%B6%E4%B8%8B%E9%A2%8C%E8%82%8C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"蝶下頜肌（頁面不存在）\">蝶下頜肌</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/sphenomandibularis\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:sphenomandibularis\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">sphenomandibularis</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>為顳肌的一部分，但有些書認為其為獨立的肌肉）</li>\n<li><span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"內翼肌\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Medial pterygoid muscle\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%85%A7%E7%BF%BC%E8%82%8C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"內翼肌（頁面不存在）\">內翼肌</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Medial_pterygoid_muscle\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Medial pterygoid muscle\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Medial pterygoid muscle</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"外翼肌\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"lateral pterygoid muscle\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%96%E7%BF%BC%E8%82%8C&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"外翼肌（頁面不存在）\">外翼肌</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/lateral_pterygoid_muscle\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:lateral pterygoid muscle\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">lateral pterygoid muscle</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span>（起自蝶骨大翼的下面和翼突的外側，止於下頜頸）</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"臨床意義\"><span id=\".E8.87.A8.E5.BA.8A.E6.84.8F.E7.BE.A9\"></span>臨床意義</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%92%80%E5%9A%BC%E8%82%8C&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"編輯章節：臨床意義\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"ilh-all\" data-orig-title=\"顳顎關節障礙\" data-lang-code=\"en\" data-lang-name=\"英语\" data-foreign-title=\"Temporomandibular joint disorder\"><span class=\"ilh-page\"><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E9%A1%B3%E9%A1%8E%E9%97%9C%E7%AF%80%E9%9A%9C%E7%A4%99&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"顳顎關節障礙（頁面不存在）\">顳顎關節障礙</a></span><span class=\"noprint ilh-comment\"><span class=\"ilh-paren\">（</span><span class=\"ilh-lang\">英語</span><span class=\"ilh-colon\">：</span><span class=\"ilh-link\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Temporomandibular_joint_disorder\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Temporomandibular joint disorder\"><span lang=\"en\" dir=\"auto\">Temporomandibular joint disorder</span></a></span><span class=\"ilh-paren\">）</span></span></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A3%A8%E7%89%99\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"磨牙\">磨牙</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考文獻\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E6.96.87.E7.8D.BB\"></span>參考文獻</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E5%92%80%E5%9A%BC%E8%82%8C&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"編輯章節：參考文獻\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95320392\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"外部連結\"><span id=\".E5.A4.96.E9.83.A8.E9.80.A3.E7.B5.90\"></span>外部連結</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\"